  "id": "country-style-fried-potatoes",
  "name": "Country-Style Fried Potatoes",
  "subtitle": "Crisp skillet potatoes with savory seasoning",
  "description": "Cubed potatoes are fried until golden, then finished with a simple blend of salt and warm spices.",
